          "id": "1768259652878",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768259652880_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Check the status and output of the REST call using `{{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_SUBSTITUTE_ITEM.$status}}` and `{{$context.$nodes.UPDATE_SUBSTITUTE_ITEM.$output}}`.\n\n- If the substitute update is successful, provide a message in this format:  \n  `Substitute updated successfully from original item {ItemNumber} to substitute item {SubstituteItem} on Work Order Number: {WorkOrderNumber}, Operation: {OperationName}, Op Seq: {OperationSequenceNumber}, Material Sequence Number: {MaterialSequenceNumber}`\n\n- If the update fails, provide a message in this format:  \n  `Failed to update substitute for original item {ItemNumber} to substitute item {SubstituteItem} on Work Order Number: {WorkOrderNumber}, Op Seq: {OperationSequenceNumber}, Material Sequence Number: {MaterialSequenceNumber}. REST error: {REST_error_message}`\n\nUse `{{$context.$nodes.CHECK_SUBSTITUTES_FOR_ITEMS_IN_WORK_ORDER.$output}}` and `{{$context.$nodes.TAKE_SHORTAGE_ACTION.$output.result}}` to obtain and populate the parameter values.\n\nDo not display any internal identifiers (IDs).  \nDo not provide suggestions or explanations.  \nReturn only the final message as per the relevant status, with all parameters populated."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
