            {
              "id": "1770888505332_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Generate a subtitle string based on the following rules, using the values for Organization Code (`{{$context.$variables.OrganizationCode}}`) and Work Order Number (` {{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}} `):\n\n- If both organization code and work order number are present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Material Shortages | Organization: {{$context.$variables.OrganizationCode}} | Work Order: {{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}} `\n- If only organization code is present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Material Shortages| Organization: {{$context.$variables.OrganizationCode}}`\n- If only work order number is present, not null, not the string \"null\", and not empty, use:  \n  `Material Shortages | Work Order: {{$context.$variables.ContextWorkOrderNumber}} `\n- Otherwise, use:  \n  `Material Shortages`\n\nReturn only the generated subtitle string. Do not return literal strings \"null\", null, empty values, or curly braces in the subtitle string."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
